ansion to live alone. She is generally cheerful, energetic and optimistic, but sometimes she finds herself feeling blue and lonely. Kanata excels at home economics, but struggles with studying overall."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Admiring the love story between her grandparents since she was little, she believes that she too, will one day find her \"prince\". Even though she is considered cute, she is still single and has never had a boyfriend. Of course, Kanata is still a virgin."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Based on her character profile on the official website."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c3183"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/42/429f589031fc83081ea7827312ece29c9c475c884036e1cd395e053de0394880.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/da/dafa1c3e967aa0806827d85b634a3820348f252bc44b1bab6f86c6554574fca8.webp","width":175,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c3184","characterName":"フロリア","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c3184"},"originalCharacterName":"フロリア","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"175"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A womanizing siren that immediately begins hitting on Kanata. He explains that, even though he is a siren, he does not sing. Floria keeps the secret behind his refusal to sing buried within himself."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Summarized from Hinano's review."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c3184"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a9/a99456f158439a3cef854b88b87872772339095e5d2bdc1229307c41